{title: Mere Rashke Qamar}
{artist: Rahat Fateh Ali Khan Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Aise [D]lehra ke tu [C]rubaroo aa gayi,        Aise [D]lehra ke tu [C]rubaroo aa gayi
[C]Dhadkane betahasha [Em]tadapane lagin,        [C]Dhadkane betahasha [Em]tadapane lagin
Teer [Em]aisa laga dard [D]aisa jagaa,        Teer [Em]aisa laga dard [D]aisa jagaa
Chot [C]dil pe wo khaayi [D]mazaa aa gayaa!        Mere [Em]rashke qamar.. [G]
Mere [Em]rashke qamar tune [Bm]pehli nazar,        Jab nazar [C]se milaai [D]maza aagaya
Josh [Em]hi josh mein meri [Bm]aagosh mein,        Aake [C]tu jo samaaai [D]mazaa aa gaya
Mere [Em]rashke qamar tune [D]pehli nazar,        Jab [C]nazar se milaai [D]maza aagaya
Jab [C]nazar se milaai [D]maza aagaya,        [Em] ... [Bm] ... [C] ... [D]
[Em] ... [C] ... [Em] ... [C],        Ret [D]hi ret thi mere [C]dil mein bhari
Ret [D]hi ret thi mere [C]dil mein bhari,        Pyaas [C]hi pyaas thi [Em]zindagi ye meri
Pyaas [C]hi pyaas thi [Em]zindagi ye meri,        Aaj [Em]sehraao mein ishq [D]ke gaaon mein
Aaj [Em]sehraao mein ishq [D]ke gaaon mein
[C]Baarishein ghir ke aayin [D]mazaa aa gaya,        Mere [Em]rashke qamar.. [G]
Mere [Em]rashke qamar tune [Bm]pehli nazar,        Jab [C]nazar se milaai [D]maza aa gaya
[Em]Ranjha ho gaye, hum [Bm]Fana ho gaye,        Aise [C]tu muskuraai [D]mazaa aa gaya
Mere [Em]rashke qamar tune [D]pehli nazar,        Jab [C]nazar se milaai [D]maza aagaya
Jab [C]nazar se milaai [Em]maza aagaya,        Barq [Em]si gir gayi [D]kaam hi kar gayi
